My name is Maya.
I am now in Mumbai.
This is the month of January.
It is nighttime outside the airport.
The air here is mild.
There is the smell of the sea in the air.
There is light everywhere here.
There is also a huge crowd here.
My bags are around me.
There is an attendant there.
He is an airport attendant.
I go near him.
I ask: "Sir, where is the prepaid taxi counter?"
He looks at me.
He asks: "Madam, do you want a taxi?"
I say: "Yes, sir."
He points ahead.
He says: "That counter is there."
I say: "Thank you, sir."
